PURPOSE of /kernel/wireless_tests/functional/radio/radio_toggle/wireless_connection_to_hidden_WPA2_passphrase_AP
Description: Establish a wireless connection to a hidden WPA2 AP and then toggle the wireless radio.
Author: Ken Benoit <kbenoit@redhat.com>
Test steps:
 * Choose which wireless interface to use and describe it
 * Disable the wired network interfaces
 * Configure the test wireless interface
 * Ping the gateway address to verify connection
 * Disable the radio for the wireless interface
 * Attempt to ping the gateway address to verify the wireless radio is disabled
 * Enable the radio for the wireless interface
 * Ping the gateway address to verify connection
 * Disable the wireless interface
 * Enable the wired network interfaces
